# Chimil, the Inner Sun: "At the beginning of your end step, discover 5" (CR 701.57a). Turn 1: Bot1 casts all six Moxes, then
# Chimil. At Bot1's end step Chimil's discover exiles Island (a land) and Arachnoid (mana value 6, over the limit), then
# Ancient Carp (mana value 5, exactly the limit), which Bot1 casts for free; the two skipped cards go to the bottom. On turn 2
# it is Bot2's end step, not "your" end step: nothing more is exiled, so Ornithopter, the next nonland card, is still in the
# library at the start of turn 3.

